# Vendored design skills, restored with
#   npx skills add "https://github.com/jakubkrehel/skills"
# and pinned by hash in skills-lock.json. Third-party content, not ours to
# carry. The installer fans the same content out into one real copy plus a
# directory of symlinks per supported agent, so all four paths are its output.
# data/skills/ is listed on its own because data/ also holds the SQLite
# database, which is ignored by the *.db rules further up rather than by a
# directory rule.
.agents/
.claude/skills/
agent/skills/
data/skills/
